ath xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>10</mn></semantics></math> N, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>10</mn></semantics></math> N và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>20</mn></semantics></math> N. Các khẳng định sau là đúng hay sai?</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/b416e7f49cd4ec6e6d1993a79b4b23dd5944b27e46a1f0cc95dccb2fd53ec39d.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
