  "solution": "<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/b416e7f49cd4ec6e6d1993a79b4b23dd5944b27e46a1f0cc95dccb2fd53ec39d.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Nếu vật chỉ chịu tác động của hai lực <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mover><mi>a</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mover><mi>b</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> thì vật sẽ chuyển động theo hướng của <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math>, vì <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tKhẳng định trên là đúng.</li><li>Ta có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>, với <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm của <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>\n\t\t\tKhẳng định trên là sai.</li><li>Giả sử lực tổng hợp là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mover><mi>m</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math>, tức là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>m</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tTừ giả thiết, ta có <br>\n\t\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>⊥</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>;</mo><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tDo đó\n\t\t\t \n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.