/mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mo>⇔</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mi>m</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>20</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mo>⇔</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mi>m</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>32</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tVậy cường độ hợp lực của <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mover><mi>a</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mover><mi>b</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mover><mi>c</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>32</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (N).</li><li>Nếu vật chịu thêm lực <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mover><mi>d</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math>, gọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>″</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là điểm đối xứng với <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> qua <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math>.<br> \n\t\t\tKhi đó ta có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mover><mi>a</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mover><mi>b</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mover><mi>d</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> vuông góc đôi một và hợp lực của ba lực này có độ lớn là \n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">hl</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>d</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">hl</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo st